Z||000000||Loki||01-05-2001||07:39 PM||||Enegine that knocks?<BR>Distributor going out?<BR>Valve float? Or whatever<P>Sometime my car has a tick tick then ranges with rpm's (no not exhaust manifolds) this is something new....Idles just fine but i fell  like is real sluggish starting around 4500 rpms....real sluggish...everything is ok, oil water volts..kinda feels like its loosing spark. But i really dont know jack about engines so here i am...<P><P>------------------<BR>Loki<BR>ICQ# 16477998<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://members.home.net/loki137/loki5.jpg"> ||||reg||1
